<title>CANADA: Aur issues 10 million shares.</title>
<headline>Aur issues 10 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aur Resources Inc said on Wednesday it entered into a bought deal to distribute 10 million common shares at C$8.25 a share.</p>
<p>The bought deal was with Research Capital Corp, the company said.</p>
<p>Aur said it also granted Research Capital the option to increase the size of the offering by one million shares.</p>
<p>Closing was expected by December 2.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the issue would be used to fund potential acquisitions and pay for ongoing exploration and development programs as well as working capital, Aur said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
